    source('src-equals-collective-reference', 'Equals 2015 film', 'Wikipedia contributors', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Equals_(film)', 'secondary_film_reference', 'Film identity and Collective context checked in a short reference pass', 'The Collective is the film’s controlled human setting.', 'No verified automated provisioning or deliberate preservation of dispensable work was found in the short check; no full viewing is claimed.'),
