    source('src-passengers-food-dialogue', 'Passengers 2016: Movie Scripts', 'Film dialogue transcribed by StockQ', 'https://www.stockq.org/moviescript/P/passengers-2016.php', 'primary_film_dialogue_transcription_indexed', 'Bounded gold-class breakfast and passenger-class dialogue read', 'Food service access differs by passenger class.', 'No full script read or food-system engineering inventory. Class difference is not evidence that every non-gold passenger is denied necessities.'),
